OL,3,GNEWSAStudents conflicted over plan for
OL,4,AMoD on campus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student has called potential plans
OL,7,Ffor Ministry of Defence (MoD) personnel
OL,8,Fto share their university campus as
OL,9,F"daunting" while others have welcomed
OL,10,Fthe idea.
OL,12,FThe University of Essex is in
OL,13,Fdiscussions with the MoD and Colchester
OL,14,FGarrison over the proposal to house 150
OL,15,Fpersonnel on its Colchester campus.
OL,17,FGrace Wren, 21, a speech and language
OL,18,Ftherapy student, said: "It's kind of
OL,19,Fdaunting in a way and it's quite scary
OL,20,Fthat there would be soldiers living
OL,21,Fnear us."
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
