OL,3,GNEWSAStudents conflicted over plan for
OL,4,AMoD on campus
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Chris Greer, the deputy
OL,7,Fvice-chancellor of University of Essex,
OL,8,Fsaid: "We are seeing if it is feasible
OL,9,Ffor us to try and provide accommodation
OL,10,Fon a temporary basis for members of the
OL,11,FGarrison for up to two years."
